{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Robot finds and grabs object, processes it, returns it. If not found, scan and move it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ReturnObject    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToFreeSpace    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsFreeSpaceAvailable    />",
